odi-p0075","role":"使纪陟诘问南阳王和","evidence":["santizhu-q-e2226881ff9e9a12f341"]},{"person":"wuzhu-p0113","role":"受诘问者；本条注称南阳王和","evidence":["santizhu-q-e2226881ff9e9a12f341"]},{"person":"shaodi-p0160","role":"暗中教其正辞自理，孙峻怒后闭门不出","evidence":["santizhu-q-e2226881ff9e9a12f341"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["santizhu-q-e2226881ff9e9a12f341"]},"ordering_evidence":"santizhu-q-e2226881ff9e9a12f341","source_order":[48,23,22],"order":8700},{"id":"santizhu-e-sr-jizhi-embassy","title":"《晋纪》纪陟使魏应对：王布马射之问、魏帝傧问、晋文王飨问","accounts":[{"id":"santizhu-a-eaa17e26aa870e0769c7","label":"裴注·干宝晋纪","text":"陟璆奉使如魏，入境问讳入国问俗；寿春将王布示马射问吴君子亦能斯乎，陟答军人骑士肄业所及士大夫未有为者，布大惭；魏帝使傧问来时吴王何如，陟对来时皇帝临轩百僚陪位御膳无恙；晋文王飨之，告以安乐公、匈奴单于在坐，陟答威恩远著；又问吴戍备几何，对自西陵以至江都五千七百里；问道里远难为坚固，对险要必争之地不过数四，文王善之厚为之礼","evidence":["santizhu-q-0e797017e3f91a35f1bf"]}],"participants":[{"person":"shaodi-p0160","role":"奉使应对，为王布、魏帝、晋文王所问","evidence":["santizhu-q-0e797017e3f91a35f1bf"]},{"person":"santizhu-p0069","role":"示马射并问，闻答大惭","evidence":["santizhu-q-0e797017e3f91a35f1bf"]},{"person":"shaodi-p0045","role":"飨纪陟并问戍备，善其应对","evidence":["santizhu-q-0e797017e3f91a35f1bf"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"未由相邻段落推算纪年；原文时间表达保留在来源引句中。","evidence":["santizhu-q-0e797017e3f91a35f1bf"]},"ordering_evidence":"santizhu-q-0e797017e3f91a35f1bf","source_order":[48,345,0],"order":8701},{"id":"santizhu-e-p023c","title":"纪陟因有密旨获特别处置","accounts":[{"id":"santizhu-a-2780dfdf74ab56c6bb53","label":"裴注·吴录","text":"纪陟因有密旨获特别处置","evidence":["santizhu-q-109834203261a8b98991"]}],"participants":[{"person":"shaodi-p0160","role":"因原文所称“有密旨”而被区别处置","evidence":["santizhu-q-109834203261a8b98991"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["santizhu-q-109834203261a8b98991"]},"ordering_evidence":"santizhu-q-109834203261a8b98991","source_order":[48,23,25],"order":8704}],"persons":[{"id":"shaodi-p0160","name":"纪陟","evidence":["shaodi-q-o185","santizhu-q-1abe36553002eacb14bf","santizhu-q-956f17a5b344a3eb7e31","santizhu-q-8aafa3f3bb101a75e9ae","santizhu-q-e37418d015bc216df881","santizhu-q-e2226881ff9e9a12f341","santizhu-q-109834203261a8b98991"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"shaodi-m-o185-shaodi-p0160","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["shaodi-q-o185"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"santizhu-q-0e797017e3f91a35f1bf","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-c3ab5e397a096c66366d","layer":"pei","quote":"干宝《晋纪》曰：“陟、璆奉使，如魏：入境而问讳，入国而问俗。寿春将王布，示之马射，既而问之曰：‘吴之君子亦能斯乎？’陟曰：‘此军人骑士，肄业所及；士大夫君子，未有为之者矣。’布大惭。既至，魏帝见之，使傧问曰：‘来时吴王何如？’陟对曰：‘来时皇帝临轩，百僚陪位，御膳无恙。’晋文王飨之，百僚毕会。使傧者告曰：‘某者安乐公也，某者匈奴单于也。’陟曰：‘西主失土，为君王所礼，位同三代，莫不感义；匈奴，边塞难羁之国，君王怀之，亲在坐席：此诚威恩远著。’又问：‘吴之戍备几何？’对曰：‘自西陵以至江都，五千七百里！’又问曰：‘道里甚远，难为坚固？’对曰：‘疆界虽远，而其险要必争之地，不过数四；犹人虽有八尺之躯，靡不受患，其护风寒亦数处耳。’文王善之，厚为之礼。”","attribution":"裴注·干宝晋纪","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":344,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-3e27b22ad0ec8aa70587","start":94,"end":422,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"santizhu-q-109834203261a8b98991","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-abd9227fad0e4bb54dc2","layer":"pei","quote":"唯陟以有密旨","attribution":"裴注·吴录","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":345,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-3e27b22ad0ec8aa70587","start":25,"end":31,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"santizhu-q-1abe36553002eacb14bf","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-1b3ba084dde8a42ed023","layer":"original","quote":"甘露元年三月，皓遣使，随绍、彧报书曰：“知以高世之才，处宰辅之任；渐导之功〖1〗，勤亦至矣。孤以不德，阶承统绪；思与贤良，共济世道；而以壅隔，未有所缘。嘉意允著〖2〗，深用依依〖3〗。今遣光禄大夫纪陟、五官中郎将弘璆，宣明至怀","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":326,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":113,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"santizhu-q-8aafa3f3bb101a75e9ae","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-5b25237441df81b49150","layer":"original","quote":"遇晋文帝崩","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":330,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":6,"end":11,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"santizhu-q-956f17a5b344a3eb7e31","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-5b25237441df81b49150","layer":"original","quote":"陟、璆至洛","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":330,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":5,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"santizhu-q-e2226881ff9e9a12f341","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-c3ab5e397a096c66366d","layer":"pei","quote":"孙峻使诘南阳王和，令其引分。陟密使令正辞自理，峻怒；陟惧，闭门不出","attribution":"裴注·吴录","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":344,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-3e27b22ad0ec8aa70587","start":22,"end":55,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"santizhu-q-e37418d015bc216df881","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-5b25237441df81b49150","layer":"original","quote":"十一月，乃遣还","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":330,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":12,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-e-o185b-q","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-acdd751b1e1832635818","layer":"original","quote":"夏四月，南深泽县言甘露降〖4〗。吴遣使纪陟、弘璆请和〖5〗。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_001.xhtml","index":335,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":30,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-b-ded6d700dc6f860d1670","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-ded6d700dc6f860d1670","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗四年：景元四年（公元 263）。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_001.xhtml","index":201,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-ef642248e44d01f3825d","start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-o165","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-b35fdf03685051716720","layer":"original","quote":"四年春二月〖1〗，复命大将军进位、爵赐，一如前诏。又固辞，乃止。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_001.xhtml","index":194,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":32,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-o171","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-cef469d41ec5962b4e48","layer":"original","quote":"咸熙元年春正月，壬戌〖1〗，槛车征邓艾〖2〗。甲子〖3〗，行幸长安。壬申〖4〗，使使者以璧币祀华山〖5〗。是月，钟会反于蜀，为众所讨。邓艾亦见杀。二月，辛卯〖6〗，特赦诸在益土者。庚申〖7〗，葬明元郭后。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_001.xhtml","index":220,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":102,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-o184","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-1096c71775017a1a0d00","layer":"original","quote":"二年春二月，甲辰〖1〗，朐顗县获灵龟以献〖2〗，归之于相国府。庚戌〖3〗，以虎贲张修，昔于成都驰马至诸营，言钟会反逆，以至没身；赐修弟倚，爵关内侯。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_001.xhtml","index":334,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":74,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-o185","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-acdd751b1e1832635818","layer":"original","quote":"夏四月，南深泽县言甘露降〖4〗。吴遣使纪陟、弘璆请和〖5〗。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_001.xhtml","index":335,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":30,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
